WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.626
Kip walked to the beach.

2
00:00:13.627 --> 00:00:21.547
It was cold and windy.

3
00:00:21.548 --> 00:00:27.336
"I'll find a new friend here," he said.

4
00:00:27.337 --> 00:00:32.459
Kip saw two seagulls.

5
00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:44.161
"They're friends with each other," said Kip.

6
00:00:44.162 --> 00:00:55.745
"They don't want to be friends with me."

7
00:00:55.746 --> 00:01:16.102
Kip saw two crabs.

8
00:01:16.103 --> 00:01:18.430
They pinched Kip's toe.

9
00:01:18.431 --> 00:01:24.040
"Ouch!" cried Kip.

10
00:01:24.041 --> 00:01:36.050
"I don't want to be friends with them!"

11
00:01:36.051 --> 00:01:39.890
Kip sat down.

12
00:01:39.891 --> 00:01:50.529
"I miss Bird," he said.

13
00:01:50.530 --> 00:01:56.094
"I wish we were still friends."

14
00:01:56.095 --> 00:01:59.391
Just then Bird landed next to Kip.

15
00:01:59.392 --> 00:02:07.035
"We're still friends," she said.

16
00:02:07.036 --> 00:02:11.732
"But you were keeping secrets," said Kip.

17
00:02:11.733 --> 00:02:15.178
"Friends shouldn't do that."

18
00:02:15.179 --> 00:02:18.312
"I'm sorry," said Bird.

19
00:02:18.313 --> 00:02:21.814
"I just didn't want you to see this."

20
00:02:21.815 --> 00:02:26.371
Bird held up a green and yellow scarf.

21
00:02:26.372 --> 00:02:36.435
"I was making it for you," said Bird.

22
00:02:36.436 --> 00:02:44.011
Kip put on the scarf.

23
00:02:44.012 --> 00:02:53.530
"Thanks for the scarf, Bird," said Kip.

24
00:02:53.531 --> 00:03:03.992
"And thanks for being my friend."

